NikTV uses dev.jdtech.mpv:libmpv:1.0.0, an optional Android MPV backend.

Wrapper source and release (MIT):
https://github.com/jarnedemeulemeester/libmpv-android/tree/v1.0.0
https://github.com/jarnedemeulemeester/libmpv-android/releases/tag/v1.0.0

The MIT wrapper license does not replace the licenses of its native libraries.
The published native build includes MPV 0.41.0 and FFmpeg 8.1, with FFmpeg's
GPL/version3 build options enabled. Redistribution must comply with the native
libraries' applicable source and license requirements, including GPLv3.

Corresponding native build scripts and dependency versions:
https://github.com/jarnedemeulemeester/libmpv-android/tree/v1.0.0/buildscripts
https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv/tree/v0.41.0
https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/tree/n8.1

Included notices: WRAPPER-LICENSE, MPV-COPYRIGHT, COPYING.GPLv3.
The upstream release/build scripts list the remaining native dependencies.
